{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923860/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.poster.avif?t=1754375689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923860/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.webm?t=1754375689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923860/extras/2aca1684ee709d1d4c072a3687b9f55f.mp4?t=1754375689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a glimpse into your rise as an underground crime boss. You'll start by managing a basic fight club in a basement: recruit fighters, organize matches, and earn cash through betting and audience revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 fight club location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic fighter training and assignment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited betting system and spectators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few early missions introducing management mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game features drug production, night club operations, weapon trade, and city-wide territory control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo focuses only on the <strong>early stages</strong> of your criminal empire, letting you explore the foundation of your underground business.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Fight Club Management</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923860/extras/7caf5d06238aeaef493392d69298d6cc.poster.avif?t=1754375689\" ><source src=\"https:/